{"id":"millo_n","lemma":"millón","pos":"noun","rank":439,"glosses":["million (10⁶)"],"ipa":"/miˈʝon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"millones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/ca/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-mill%C3%B3n.wav","formAudio":{"millones":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/fe/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-millones.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Usted es nuestro cliente un millón.","en":"You're our one millionth customer.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/730781","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"our, ours, to us"},{"g":"client"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Hay miles de millones de estrellas en el cielo.","en":"There are billions of stars in the sky.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/610920","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"thousands"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"star","l":"estrella"},{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"sky"}]},{"text":"Ojalá tuviera un millón de dólares.","en":"I wish I had a million dollars.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355090","words":[{"g":"I wish"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"dollar","l":"dólar"}]},{"text":"Él recibió más de seis millones de votos.","en":"He received more than six million votes.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to receive, get","l":"recibir"},{"g":"more"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"six"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"vote","l":"voto"}]},{"text":"Sé que tendrás un millón de preguntas.","en":"I know you must have a million questions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/300120","words":[{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"question","l":"pregunta"}]}]}